          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que cuenta la cantidad de pacientes que toman un número determinado de medicamentos o principios activos distintos a lo largo de su seguimiento:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    drug_count,\n    COUNT(person_id) AS number_of_patients\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        de.person_id,\n        COUNT(DISTINCT de.drug_concept_id) AS drug_count\n    FROM\n        `drug_exposure` AS de\n    GROUP BY\n        de.person_id\n) AS drug_counts_per_person\nGROUP BY\n    drug_count\nORDER BY\n    drug_count;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CoMBAY89a1_wZLstc_7Vg5BqzL3rz69AIRChcBl-NlscNk8uoNT8_7hVVdWXaxKMG56t-YfJn-38GAG51yXXs-1vyVQtR0_l7zscBG7pTlNyqQN6iJzz1gsbmMpWfoFSeV9al2lhynWHIZjUUadk7IfelE6WLBp4VGkzRdG6Tv8LfGk14VQ="
